{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our intrepid and down-right adorable adventurer Flibbius returns in...*drum rolll*\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Temple of the Toad King!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take our lovable goofball Flibbius armed with spaghetti arms, a backpack and a trunk of ingenious puzzle solving through a grand journey. Solve puzzles, craft items, meet wacky and endearing characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896500/extras/8f481dc3b1dce11ad0fb7f212eabdc10.avif?t=1773658774\" width=600 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're taking Flibbius on a bigger adventure this time filled with underwater exploration, tree-top zip lining and grappling gun shooting. (All made of his own brilliant inventions of course!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896500/extras/ce8080190f64d5d11518c8ae0ef3f672.avif?t=1773658774\" width=600 height=146 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A varied and richer world than ever before waiting to be explored: Savannah, Jungle Canopies, Mangroves and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new array of wacky, funny, silly and memorable characters to meet and make friends with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A journal with secret puzzle hints in case you get a bit stuck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works fantastically on Steam Deck!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896500/extras/fd349b233666278f1222f6eb01a02d6c.avif?t=1773658774\" width=600 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please join our discord channel if you want to keep up to date with our progress, find out when the demo launches or ask us any questions at all! Or follow our journey on any of our other social channels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896500/extras/2af50d4f09681b74c9c5421a78f82596.avif?t=1773658774\" width=600 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! This game was made by a husband and wife team and is self-funded and self-published. We hope you will enjoy playing it! Your support means so much to us and we'd love to hear what you think.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3896500?t=1773658774","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3896500?t=1773658774","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896500/80ba266975553ae76b141cd5babc249b7b8f55da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773658774","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896500/80ba266975553ae76b141cd5babc249b7b8f55da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773658774","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our intrepid and down-right adorable a